# Murder ({1}{B}{B}, "Destroy target creature.") kills Bot1's own Ornithopter and then Bot2's: any creature, whoever controls
# it and whatever else it is (an artifact creature here), is a legal target (CR 701.8a, 115.1). A land is not a creature, so
# Murder refuses Bot2's Island. Two Black Lotuses pay the two Murders (BBB each, the {1} paid from the third B).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Murder
Murder
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Island x10

